{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A catastrophic event has shattered a powerful spirit, splitting it into two smaller beings and scattering its immense power across the world. Bound by their shared purpose, the two spirits must embark on a journey to reclaim what has been lost. Take control of both characters simultaneously as you solve challenging puzzles, overcome trials, and uncover the hidden truth behind their shared destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Gameplay Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simultaneously guide two spirits with the same movement keys, solving unique puzzles along the way. As one moves, the other follows - together, they must navigate the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/GameHook_Gif_Optimized.gif?t=1743268340\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore stunning, hand-crafted environments, each brimming with detail and unique atmospheres. Every chapter unfolds its own captivating story, inviting you to discover hidden secrets and experience a world that feels alive with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/Puzzle_Gif_Optimized.gif?t=1743268340\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and unlock new abilities throughout your journey, each offering fresh, creative ways to approach and solve the challenges you\u2019ll encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/Portals_Gif_Optimized.gif?t=1743268340\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1906430?t=1743268340","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.stea